    "detailed_description": "\u300eThe Maker\u300f<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeep in the forest, in a secluded cabin, lived a puppeteer. With a letter of request in hand, delivered to the postbox, the puppeteer creates dolls tonight. The never-ending rain, an old record playing classical music, the radio announcing missing persons... What is the puppeteer's secret?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSystem<br />\r\nA 3D, immersive FPS game. Progress through the game with clicks and key inputs. It is a short game with a playtime of around 15 minutes. Create the dolls and complete your tasks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls<br />\r\nMove: A\uff0bD<br />\r\nCamera rotation: Mouse",
